        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.533203125,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "74.0–99.0) among studies of the intervention regimen, and 70%–85.7%, with a random effects pooled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971412658691406,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3902587890625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "proportion of 75.0% (95% CI: 69.0–81.0) among studies of the comparator regimen. Neurological",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.2067260742188,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "sequelae were defined and assessed differently across studies. Among patients treated with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.1925659179688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "intervention regimen, 50.0%–66.7% had neurological sequelae, mostly categorized as mild. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.38916015625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "vast majority of these were among patients diagnosed at stage 2 or 3. Among patients treated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.3892211914062,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "the comparator regimen, 31.9%–50.0% had neurological sequelae. In one study on the comparator",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.396728515625,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "regimen from India, 17 of 29 (58.6%) cases were categorized as mild. The random effects pooled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.3958129882812,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "proportions of neurological sequelae among survivors were 66.0% (95% CI: 55.0–75.0) and 36.0%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        524.60595703125,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 30.0–43.0) for the intervention and comparator regimens, respectively. Among the 135 HIV-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991246223449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        527.3905029296875,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "negative and 13 HIV-positive patients who received the intervention regimen in South Africa, none",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        460.13751220703125,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "relapsed within two years of post-treatment. Other studies did not report on relapse.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        527.4114379882812,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Because of the non-comparative nature of the studies, which were all observational, narrative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.49464416503906,
        527.4453735351562,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "descriptions reporting pooled proportions were provided rather than estimated measures of effect.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        527.386962890625,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "The certainty of evidence was deemed to be very low for all outcomes due to very serious risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.1563720703125,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "bias, serious or very serious inconsistency within regimens, and very serious indirectness. Imprecision",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99484920501709,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        343.8564147949219,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "could not be assessed due to the lack of comparative data.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.6005249023438,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "The reviewers concluded that pooled estimates need to be interpreted with caution considering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.3091430664062,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "the small number of studies, the potential for confounding by indication, other potential residual",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.425537109375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "confounding and between-study heterogeneity regarding the assessment of neurological sequelae.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.72662353515625,
        527.39599609375,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "GDG considerations:  While the GDG members discussed evidence of benefits of the intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.3936157226562,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "regimen and biological plausibility, they noted the very low certainty of the data. The GDG members",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        527.2692260742188,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "decided to choose that the balance of effects ‘does not favour either the intervention or the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.5025939941406,
        527.3992919921875,
        410.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "comparison’. This decision reflects that both the desirable and undesirable effects varied, as well as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.7025146484375,
        527.0932006835938,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "the very low certainty of the evidence overall. Recognizing how quickly the condition of children with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995849609375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.9026184082031,
        527.42236328125,
        437.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "TBM can deteriorate, GDG members were not comfortable favouring one regimen over the other,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.10260009765625,
        271.0103759765625,
        450.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "based on the very low certainty of the data.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.8065185546875,
        527.412109375,
        472.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "The GDG members also noted that the feasibility of introducing the shorter intensive regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.0065002441406,
        527.2704467773438,
        485.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "is dependent on the setting. Acceptability, affordability and access to the component medicines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.2065124511719,
        527.2992553710938,
        498.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "(including the child-friendly ethionamide formulation, a 125 mg dispersible tablet) are important",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.406494140625,
        527.4255981445312,
        511.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "contextual factors as well as any additional implementation considerations such as the necessity and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.60650634765625,
        527.4454345703125,
        525.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "availability of monitoring tests that are needed with the shorter regimen. GDG members thought that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986641883850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.8065185546875,
        527.6007690429688,
        538.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "the short intensive regimen would probably be acceptable as it includes medicines that have been in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998899459838867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.0064697265625,
        527.1832885742188,
        551.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "use for many years, including first line medicines and ethionamide. The intervention regimen is more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996249198913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.20654296875,
        527.4044799804688,
        564.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "costly than the comparator regimen, but refers to the costs of medicines only; GDG members stated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.406494140625,
        467.03118896484375,
        577.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "that other costs (including to patients, families and the health system) were important.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.1104125976562,
        527.4231567382812,
        599.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "The GDG acknowledged the limited data on alternative regimens to treat TBM and the need",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.3104248046875,
        527.5906372070312,
        612.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "for continued efforts to optimize and better understand treatment options for TBM, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.5103759765625,
        287.4580993652344,
        625.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "implementation considerations, such as dosing.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.3035888671875,
        293.731689453125,
        660.18359375
      ],
      "text": "5.2.2. Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.2116088867188,
        527.283447265625,
        680.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "Children living with HIV infection:  Most studies in the review were restricted to HIV-negative",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
