      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.5875854492188,
        527.4389038085938,
        694.0305786132812
      ],
      "text": "children. HIV-positive children represented a small proportion of children with TBM overall, and all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.78759765625,
        527.424560546875,
        707.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "received the intervention regimen. In the three studies using the intervention regimen included in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
