    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.9876098632812,
        527.4453735351562,
        720.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "the evidence review, 11 children were identified as having HIV infection (of a total of 724 children).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.1876220703125,
        527.4366455078125,
        733.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, it was not possible to undertake analyses stratified by HIV infection. An additional small",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.3875732421875,
        527.4365234375,
        746.83056640625
