      "text": "study of 13 children from South Africa used an extended duration of the intervention regimen (i.e.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.5875854492188,
        527.4431762695312,
        760.0305786132812
